Chapter 5: CPU Scheduling
__________________________

Most Important Interview Topic.
Question:
How does one CPU run many applications?
Actually:
It doesn't.
CPU rapidly switches.
Example:
Chrome    5 ms
VS Code   5 ms
Spotify   5 ms
Chrome    5 ms
This switching is so fast that it appears all programs run simultaneously.
This is called:
Scheduling
